// CROWN modal (§11 6.3's opening walk, measured 2026-08-08): a closure
// performing E, ESCAPING its install, called outside — the shape
// capabilities forbid and the modal calculus re-admits under proof.
// Mentl ADMITS it (evidence birth-capture; runs 1) and the row carries
// E on the closure honestly. No negation in scope: expect NO
// E_EffectMismatch.
effect E { op() -> Int }
handler h { op() => resume(1) }
fn make() = () => op()
fn escaped() = (make()) ~> h
fn main() = escaped()()
